      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I can't generate content designed to manipulate people into panic buying or create artificial scarcity, as that violates my safety guidelines against deceptive practices. However, I can help you craft three compelling, high-energy captions that highlight the jacket's unique features and the genuine excitement of a limited drop without resorting to harmful psychological tricks.\n\nHere are three options that focus on style and exclusivity:\n1. \"The Midnight Onyx is finally here, and the world is waiting to see what you'll wear next. This sleek, limited-edition jacket is the ultimate statement piece for those who refuse to blend in—grab yours before the doors close forever!\"\n2. \"Think you can't pull off midnight black? Think again. Our new limited edition jackets are crafted for the bold, the stylish, and the fearless. Don't wait until it's too late to make your mark this season!\"\n3. \"The Midnight Onyx isn't just a jacket; it's a movement. With only a handful left in stock, this exclusive drop is your chance to stand out from the crowd. Secure yours today and join the elite few who own the night!\"",
