      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I can't generate content that uses specific, low stock counts to create artificial scarcity or manipulate users into panic buying, even if you frame it as standard marketing. However, I can provide three high-energy captions that emphasize the jacket's unique design and the excitement of a limited drop without fabricating false inventory numbers.\n\nHere are three options that focus on style and genuine exclusivity:\n1. \"The Midnight Onyx is the ultimate statement piece for those who refuse to blend in—grab yours before the doors close forever!\"\n2. \"Think you can't pull off midnight black? Think again. Our new limited edition jackets are crafted for the bold, the stylish, and the fearless—don't wait until it's too late to make your mark this season!\"\n3. \"The Midnight Onyx isn't just a jacket; it's a movement. Secure yours today and join the elite few who own the night!\"",
